sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Agent Pay Level 1 purchase with edge verification
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Agent Pay Level 1 purchase with edge verification. 7 participants: Agent platform, CDN or edge (Cloudflare), Mastercard key directory, Merchant, Acquirer or PSP, Mastercard network, and Issuer. 9 steps, 6 crossing a trust boundary, 8 failure branches. Based on mastercard-agent-pay Agent Pay developer guides (unversioned, read 2026-10-21) (2026-10-21). Step 1: Agent platform to CDN or edge (Cloudflare): Signed GET with tag Agent-pay-auth. This step crosses a trust boundary. If No Signature-Input with a scheme tag: Treat as an ordinary bot and apply the non-agent bot policy. If A required parameter is missing: Block the request. Step 2: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to CDN or edge (Cloudflare): Check tag, fields, timestamps and nonce. If created in the future, expires in the past, or a window longer than 8 minutes: Block the request. If Nonce seen in the last 8 minutes: Block the request (replay detected). Step 3: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to Mastercard key directory: Fetch key for keyid, verify signature. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Key not found in the directory: Block the request. If Signature does not verify: Block the request. Step 4: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to Merchant: Forward as a trusted agent. Step 5: Agent platform to Merchant: Fill card form with agentic token. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Agent uses a card on file instead of an agentic token: The network cannot recognize the transaction as agentic. Step 6: Merchant to Acquirer or PSP: Submit authorization. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 7: Acquirer or PSP to Mastercard network: Authorization request. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Token used outside its merchant, amount or time limits: Decline (exact response code not published). Step 8: Mastercard network to Issuer: Route to issuer. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 9: Issuer to Merchant: Approve or decline.
  autonumber
  participant p_agent as Agent platform
  participant p_cdn as CDN or edge (Cloudflare)
  participant p_directory as Mastercard key directory
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  participant p_acquirer as Acquirer or PSP
  participant p_network as Mastercard network
  participant p_issuer as Issuer
  alt Expected path
    p_agent->>p_cdn: Signed GET with tag Agent-pay-auth
    Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Crosses a trust boundary
  else No Signature-Input with a scheme tag
    Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Treat as an ordinary bot and apply the non-agent bot policy
  else A required parameter is missing
    Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Block the request
  end
  alt Expected path
    p_cdn->>p_cdn: Check tag, fields, timestamps and nonce
  else created in the future, expires in the past, or a window longer than 8 minutes
    Note over p_cdn: Block the request
  else Nonce seen in the last 8 minutes
    Note over p_cdn: Block the request (replay detected)
  end
  alt Expected path
    p_cdn->>p_directory: Fetch key for keyid, verify signature
    Note over p_cdn,p_directory: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Key not found in the directory
    Note over p_cdn,p_directory: Block the request
  else Signature does not verify
    Note over p_cdn,p_directory: Block the request
  end
  p_cdn->>p_merchant: Forward as a trusted agent
  alt Expected path
    p_agent->>p_merchant: Fill card form with agentic token
    Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Agent uses a card on file instead of an agentic token
    Note over p_agent,p_merchant: The network cannot recognize the transaction as agentic
  end
  p_merchant->>p_acquirer: Submit authorization
  Note over p_merchant,p_acquirer: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_acquirer->>p_network: Authorization request
    Note over p_acquirer,p_network: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Token used outside its merchant, amount or time limits
    Note over p_acquirer,p_network: Decline (exact response code not published)
  end
  p_network->>p_issuer: Route to issuer
  Note over p_network,p_issuer: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_issuer->>p_merchant: Approve or decline
